### 토큰 일부분 지우고 요청 -> JWT 시그니쳐가 일치하지 않아서 예외 발생
### eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc4Mjc5NzQ0NCwiZXhwIjoxNzgyNzk3NzQ0LCJrZXkiOiJ2YWx1ZSJ9.eDWUtnuS9qdYj4ef9DKVDlUmAUTCss3vrulRyC-UiRLgW6I17zecMOLG3GuEnRRl
GET http://localhost:8080/member/3
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc4Mjc5NjYxMywiZXhwIjoxNzgyNzk2OTEzLCJrZXkiOiJ2YWx1ZSJ9.ORrSGaYrHDLMTOKTNgbJBnK97Wm-FkpIa8f1HYG69Ht7TMBdb1X_MSDOUr7fM


### 토큰 없이 요청 보내기 -> CustomAuthenticationEntryPoint 동작
GET http://localhost:8080/member/3
# Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc4Mjc5NjYxMywiZXhwIjoxNzgyNzk2OTEzLCJrZXkiOiJ2YWx1ZSJ9.ORrSGaYrHDLMTOKTNgbJBnK97Wm-FkpIa8f1HYG69Ht7TMBdb1X_MSDOUr7fM


### 권한 문제 테스트 (인가 문제) -> CustomAccessDeniedHandler 동작
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user3",
  "password": "1234"
}

